WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.520
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.990
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:16.490
I'm a second-year at the idol 
middle school, Four Star Academy.

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:21.830
As a top idol in S4, I work hard at my Aikatsu every day.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:30.210
Ever since Venus Ark docked, we've gotten ourselves into one incident after another.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:37.350
Before we knew what was happening, the headmaster sent us to be exchange students at Venus Ark,

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:40.680
where we'll learn more about Star Premium Rare Coords.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:44.690
I'm so nervous, I can't contain my jitters!

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:48.980
Here we are.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:50.150
Yeah.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:54.070
They told us we only needed to bring the bare necessities...

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:59.620
Mahiru, what're you packing?

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:03.710
We're going behind enemy lines, so I prepared for the worst.

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:06.000
I brought three hundred tiles!

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:09.920
A-Anyway, let's board.

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:11.840
Ossu!

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:20.850
Welcome to Venus Ark,

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:22.970
Japan's idols. {figure it's fine and not japanese}

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:25.770
I'm Nijino Yume from Four Star Academy.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:28.150
Sakuraba Rola, from the same.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:30.860
Kasumi Mahiru, from the same.

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:34.030
We'll send you on a tour of the ship for starters.

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:37.570
I've called a very special guide for you.

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:39.620
Special?

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:43.330
What is it, Mahiru?

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:46.250
I can smell Onee-chan again.

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:54.010
<b><i>Koharu-chan?</i></b>

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:57.180
Koharu-chan!

00:01:57.180 --> 00:02:01.180
It's been far too long, Yume-chan, Rola, Mahiru-chan.

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:02.760
Koharu-chan!

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:06.180
It's Koharu-chan!

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:09.560
I knew that voice back then was you!

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:13.860
And that fragrance was from the body mist Onee-chan gave you as a parting gift!

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:17.490
Why didn't you ever tell us you were on this ship?

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:18.400
Yeah, that!

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:20.910
Girls, not all at once.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:22.780
But that hardly matters...

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:24.700
Welcome back, Koharu-chan!

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:25.700
Thanks!

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:04.260
How was it in Italy?

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:07.890
There's so much I want to ask you, Koharu-chan!

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:09.890
Calm down, Yume-chan.

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:16.650
Go to the cabin and change into Venus Ark uniforms like proper exchange students.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:19.690
Koharu Nanakura, if you would.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.530
Of course, Elza-sama.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.570
"Elza-sama"?

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:27.910
Now then, change into these.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.580
This feels good and is easy to move in.{not going with "this is comfy and easy to wear"?}

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.750
You're right, it fits like a glove.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:37.040
Yeah, this uniform isn't half bad!

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:41.800
I modified the sleeves and other proportions to suit you all.

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:43.380
You did?

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:44.220
Yeah.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:47.550
Thanks! But enough of that...

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:49.970
What in the world is going on, Koharu?!

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.060
Tell us everything!

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:54.310
S-Sorry! I'll explain from the beginning.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:05:00.440
Okay, so when I got to see dresses made in Italy, the capital of fashion, up close,

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:03.990
it sparked an interest in design, 
and I started studying it in earnest.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:08.700
That makes sense. You've always been good at design.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:12.120
You were a huge help during that audition I had.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:16.830
Thanks. It was right around then that Elza-sama came to Italy.

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:20.090
Her singing was amazing, of course,

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:23.340
but it was her dress that stole my heart.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.260
When I went to speak to her...

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.220
You want me to come to Venus Ark?

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:31.350
I saw your designs.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:36.270
Although it's still unrefined, 
you have great potential talent. {this is why you watch first}

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:37.480
Huh?

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:42.980
Come aboard my ship at once, 
and set your sights upon a new goal.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:44.990
The perfect designer.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.450
That's amazing, Koharu!

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:51.330
But why didn't you tell us?

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:54.500
I had wanted to wait until I was confident enough.

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:59.500
But now that I know I want to be a designer, I feel that time has come.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.090
I see.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.250
You're the same as ever, Koharu.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.630
Yeah, you haven't changed a bit.

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:11.350
Are you sure it was a good idea letting Koharu be their guide?

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:16.640
I have nothing to hide. In fact, it would be best for them to see everything.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:21.020
Even if that leads to Koharu asking to return to Four Star Academy?

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:23.400
I'm afraid I can't allow that yet.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:31.780
When I gave her the first design assignment, 
she came back with 380 ideas in a single night.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:35.490
And no two of them resembled each other.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:40.750
Her passion for design has drawn my interest.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.710
How very intriguing.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.550
This tastes marvelous.

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:51.930
Yes, it is Matsusaka beef from this country.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.140
I see, it's Japanese.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:02.480
I can only hope Japan's idols have as deep a flavor.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:07.610
I'll give you the grand tour now. This is the entrance.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.490
We were here just the other day.

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.280
Huh, you were?

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.660
Well, a lot happened.

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:18.250
I just remembered, Koharu-chan. Are your parents still in Italy?

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:23.670
Yeah. When Elza-sama scouted me, I had a lot of doubts about it.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:27.710
But they told me to pursue what I truly wanted to.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.260
I'm so glad for you, Koharu-chan.

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.340
Thanks!

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:35.760
This is a classroom.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:37.140
You're just in time—

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:39.430
Congratulation!

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:40.270
Huh?!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.520
Yuri-senpai?!

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:42.810
Yuri?

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:46.610
I'm Liszt Juli, from Hungary. {first time I've been happy to have Hungarian blood}{let your magyar spirit awaken}

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:48.070
Nice to meet you.

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:51.070
Isn't she like Yuri-senpai's twin sister?

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.320
You must be the exchange students from Japan.

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:56.950
We're in the middle of a design lesson. Stay and observe if you'd like.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:07:59.450
Those girls...

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.120
Why are they blindfolded?

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.420
Just watch.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:05.460
Are you ready?

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:06.590
Yes.

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:09.420
Answer starting from the top-right sample.

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:15.300
Cotton chambray from France.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.220
Ding dong! On to the next.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:24.100
Wool muslin from England.

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:25.770
Bzz-bzzt!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.860
That's from China.

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:30.780
Focus on the nerve endings in your fingertips.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:31.690
Yes.

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.740
She can tell just from touching it?

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:34.740
What do you think?

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.450
It's incredible!

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.950
This is just the intro lesson though.

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.120
That's...

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.500
The intro?

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:43.910
Yume-chan.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:45.460
Look over here.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:49.460
They're such refined designs.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:55.130
These are our school dresses. They were all produced and designed by Elza-sama herself.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.720
Elza-san made them?

00:08:57.260 --> 00:09:01.970
It's the complete opposite of Four Star Academy's self-produce philosophy.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:06.480
They seem to be denying the students' individualities altogether.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:07.980
Your impression is accurate.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:14.700
Under my instruction, every idol on this boat is molded in my image.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:15.860
However...

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:21.490
Wouldn't you agree that the individuality that breaks the mold is rightfully called true individuality?

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.250
True...

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:24.370
Individuality.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.500
I believe you've already met Kirara.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.500
Oh, yes.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:36.090
She also began by wearing only dresses that I produced.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:40.760
But in time, they became unable to constrain the light of her individuality.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.720
Thus I allowed her a personal brand.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:48.350
I can see disagreement in your eyes.

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:50.190
N-No, it's just—

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:51.860
I do disagree.

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:55.990
And that will not change until I see Venus Ark's Aikatsu for myself.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:59.910
Mahiru Kasumi.

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:04.370
I see. You certainly are the younger sister of Yozora.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.960
You know my sister?

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:11.750
You should not be surprised. She's Perfect Elza.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:15.800
Mahiru's point is valid.

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:21.510
Let us have you witness the Aikatsu of Venus Ark with your own eyes.

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:25.180
Yes, the Aikatsu of a new age!

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:40.070
So this is the lesson room.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:53.340
This is Venus Ark Aikatsu?

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:56.960
It doesn't look like they're doing anything particularly different.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:59.340
It's just regular exercise.

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:01.720
So it seems, doesn't it?

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:04.720
Virtual program:

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:06.100
Terminate!

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.730
The equipment disappeared!

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:13.150
No, it never existed!

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:16.730
But they acted like it was really there...

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:18.360
You get it?

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:23.120
This routine simultaneously trains both your physical strength and your acting skills.

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:24.580
Wow...

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:29.120
It's like an evolved form of Hime-senpai's training, Himetrain.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:33.630
It's a completely new exercise. It's called...

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:35.790
Elzacise!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.380
Next one. Are you ready?

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:42.590
Yes!

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:44.890
Let's Elzacise!

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:47.140
Let's Elzacise!

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:58.860
This is the homeland of Johanna, the girl over there.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:02.820
It's a stereoscopic virtual environment based on Matterhorn in Switzerland.

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:03.860
Unbelievable...

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:06.830
They look like they're climbing a real mountain.

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.290
One more set!

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.080
Where now?

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:15.580
The birthplace of Luksana-chan in the front. {not sure of her name}{don't know what it should be, but ks > x since it's not from a latin-using place}

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.800
It's the Sahara Desert in Algeria.

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:20.840
This is like a real desert.

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:22.550
I can even feel the heat.

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:25.340
But they're all still moving the same way...

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:28.260
Have you already forgotten what Elza said?

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:29.010
Huh?

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.980
That concludes today's Elzacise.

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.400
Yes!

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:37.690
Rei, Koharu, come here.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:44.910
Hey, hey! Where's Ako-chan?

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:46.450
She didn't come.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:50.120
What?! But she's so funny!

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:53.870
Missing Ako-chan is so baa!

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:59.630
Does it look like Kirara lacks individuality?

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:00.880
Well...

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:07.390
Individuality that surfaces even after having your individuality taken away is true individuality. {if I have to deal with hearing it thrice, everyone else has to deal with reading it thrice}

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:11.720
If you plan to study at Venus Ark, do not forget that.

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:14.940
Kirara, return to your position.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:16.400
Okay!

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:18.440
Attention, ladies.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:24.530
These idols of Four Star Academy have come to study Venus Ark's Aikatsu as part of a short exchange program.

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.320
I'm Nijino Yume.

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:28.030
Sakuraba Rola.

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:29.870
Kasumi Mahiru.

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:31.740
We look forward to learning with you.

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:37.170
I've seen those girls before.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:41.300
Their singing was pretty decent for idols from Japan.

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:44.170
Decent, she says.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.800
We're happy to have you.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:51.680
Feel free to ask us if you ever need help.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.680
They don't seem to be bad people though.

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.310
Yeah.

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:59.810
And since you three are here on exchange...

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:04.030
That means you must be competing in the Aikatsu Ranking!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:05.780
Aikatsu Ranking?

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:08.200
I've heard about it from Onee-chan.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:12.330
It's a legendary event held once every four years.

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.450
The Aikatsu Ranking!

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:16.330
A legendary event?

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:19.790
That's right! Anyone's free to participate.

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:25.960
You get points for doing certain events and performances over the course of the year.

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:31.470
At the end of the year, the top-ranked idols are gathered for one final competition.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.850
Rest assured.

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:38.730
The three of you have already been entered.

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:41.770
When did you do that?

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:43.520
I don't mind.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:44.860
Mahiru-chan?

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:47.530
We'd end up facing off sooner or later anyway.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.830
I'm not so sure about that.

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:57.410
Japanese idols are on such a different level, they may be too baaad to make it.{is this going to be a thing}{nobody knows}

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:59.540
You wanna say that to my face?!

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:01.290
R-Rola...

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:06.130
In that case, we can push your welcome party to a later date.

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:08.840
Tonight, come witness our performance.

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:10.680
"Our"?

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:13.930
Yes, Kirara and I will be on stage.

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:21.020
It's about time.

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:22.860
Yeah, I'm so excited!

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:25.940
Let's see just how good Venus Ark is.

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:28.690
Looks like it's starting.

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:36.080
Let's do this, Kirara.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.080
Yes, Elza-sama!

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:41.330
Dresses strengthen me.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:45.340
Come have a fluffy sweet dream with Kirara!

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:13.380
What did you think of their performance?

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:17.010
Elza-sama wore the Passion Venus Coord.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:20.630
Kirara-chan had the Milky Venus Coord.

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:24.140
Both of them are Venus Ark school dresses.

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:25.890
I was astounded.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:29.270
Elza-san's red flowers burning bright.

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:33.150
And Kirara's flowery pop color arrangement.{kaleidoscopic?}

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:38.280
They weren't even Premium Rare Dresses, but they were gleaming so much. {I've never been this mad at Yume or any aikatsu before. She fucking literally did the same thing with Rola three episodes ago. That was the literal point of the episode. Is she retarded?}{maybe the difference between the observed gleaming and the expected gleaming in this episode was outside experimental error?}

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:42.610
The dresses may have been amazing, 
but their idol levels were off the charts! {over niNE THOUSAAAAND}{this was my first meme}

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:45.490
This is Venus Ark.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:54.130
Their performance was seriously unbelievable.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:54.960
Yeah.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.290
Oh, right!

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:58.300
Do any of you want candy?

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.170
I bought them in Italy.

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:03.550
I'll have one!

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:04.680
Thanks!

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:15.690
We came to study Venus Ark's Aikatsu, 
but today we were at the mercy of their winds.{I would've not made the second half like that, but I don't feel strongly enough to de-colorize it}

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:18.190
Honestly, I feel outdone.

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:20.690
You're just as amazing as them!

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:25.780
In just one year, you fulfilled your dream of making S4, Yume-chan.

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:29.200
Mahiru-chan, you beat your sister, Yozora-senpai.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:33.580
And Rola, you're a respected admin who supports the entire school.

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:36.840
It might be strange for me to say this since I left halfway through,

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:42.380
but your Aikatsu are just as good as what they do at Venus Ark!

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:45.140
Thanks, Koharu-chan.

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:49.600
Still, the glimmer of their Star Premium Rare Coords...

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.600
Without those...

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:57.230
Oh, you know, Elza-sama told me something.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.280
Koharu Nanakura.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:02.780
Do you know what these are?

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:04.530
N-No.

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:07.490
These are raw gemstones.{or raw}{I actually had raw but apparently rough is "correct"}

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:12.950
All potential idols begin like one of these pebbles.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:17.540
They are polished through their Aikatsu until they eventually become beautiful gemstones.

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:23.800
And if we idols are gemstones, 
then rings and crowns are dresses.{this one is... fine}

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:26.300
An idol and her dress must be as one.

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:31.060
It is a dress's duty to draw out the apex of our brilliance.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:32.560
I have high hopes for you,

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:33.770
Koharu.

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:41.940
Hearing that made me want to keep growing into a designer who can make everyone shine.

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:45.490
Let's all work hard towards our goals together!

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:48.660
Yeah... that's right.

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.280
What is it, Yume?

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:51.830
I just remembered.

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:55.750
We can't just ignore Venus Ark's power.

00:21:55.750 --> 00:22:00.630
We have to face Elza-san's power head on and improve ourselves. {good job remembering something from three days ago}

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:03.630
We can't just ignore it, huh.

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:05.510
That gets me going!

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:08.390
And from now on, Koharu-chan's back with us.

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:10.390
It's Aikatsu at Venus Ark.

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:11.470
Let's do this!

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:12.760
Yeah!

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:15.520
Let's do <i>that</i> and get back into it!

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:19.190
Here we go!

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:21.860
Aikatsu!

00:23:56.490 --> 00:24:00.580
Elza-san in her Passion Venus Coord held a stunning performance.

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:05.500
Yeah. Her dress was amazing too, but her idol power was ridiculously high!

00:24:05.500 --> 00:24:09.170
It makes me want to grow as an idol myself!

00:24:10.970 --> 00:24:12.090
I'll use karate.

00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:13.800
And I'll use kendo.

00:24:13.800 --> 00:24:15.760
Let the battle begin!

00:24:15.760 --> 00:24:17.430
Is that kind of fight possible?!

00:24:17.760 --> 00:24:19.430
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.850 --> 00:24:21.180
Kya! The Warning! {キャッ！と注意報 what do you think, it might be a play on cat}{it's certainly a play on cat, but I don't really want to make it "Cat Warning"}{saaaaaa}

00:24:21.180 --> 00:24:23.690
Become the first-star idol!
